{"id":"word:hebrew:H8141","type":"word","title":"שָׁנֶה","subtitle":"H8141 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a year (as a revolution of time)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שָׁנֶה (H8141) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 880 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שָׁנֶה (shâneh) means a year (as a revolution of time) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 21."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שָׁנֶה","transliteration":"shâneh","pronunciation":"shaw-neh'","strong":"H8141","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8141","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["שָׁנָ֔ה","שָׁנָ֑ה","שָׁנָ֖ה","שָׁנָה֙","שָׁנָֽה"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",420],["HNcfpa",126],["HR/Ncfsc",76],["HRd/Ncfsa",59],["HNcfsc",31],["HTd/Ncfsa",24],["HAcmdc",20],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",17],["HR/Ncfsa",16],["HC/Rd/Ncfsa",13]]},"definitions":{"short":"a year (as a revolution of time)","usage":"whole age, × long, old, year(× -ly).","full":"H8141. shanah שָׁנָה 877 noun feminine (on apparent exception see Albr ZAW xvi (1896), 46 ) year (etymology see √); — absolute ׳שׁ Amos 2:10 +; construct שְׁנַת Gen 41:50 +; suffix שְׁנָתוֺ Ezek 46:13 +, שְׁנָתָהּ Lev 14:10 2 t.; dual שְׁנָתַיִם Amos 1:1 +, תָ֑יִם - 1Kin 15:25 +; plural שָׁנִים Exod 21:2 +, construct שְׁנֵי Gen 23:1 24t., שְׁנוֺת Deut 32:7-8 t. (in poetry and late); suffix שְׁנָיו Lev 25:52 4 t. suffix; שְׁנוֺתַי Isa 38:15 ; Psa 31:11 , שְׁנוֺתָם 78:33 8 t. suffix; — year , as division of time, Exod 23:14 , 17 3 t. בַּשָּׁנָה +, etc.; הַשּׁ ׳רֵשִׁית Deut 11:12 , opposed to הַשּׁ ׳אַחֲרִית 11:12 , הַשּׁ ׳צֵאת Exod 23:16 , הַשּׁ ׳תְּקוּפַת 34:22 ; 2Chr 24:23 , הַשּׁ ׳תְּשׁוּבַת 2Sam 11:1 +, etc.; שָׁנָה בָּא 2Kin 13:20 , read ᵐ5 שׁ ׳כְּבֹא Bur, שׁ ׳בארץ ׳בְשׁ Kit, compare ׳שׁ ׳בְשׁ = year by year 1Sam 1:7 +; בַּשָּׁנָה Benz, compare Neh 10:33 ; so ׳שׁ ׳שׁ Deut 14:22 , ׳שׁ שׁ ׳אַחֲרֵי 2Sam 21:1 , ׳בְּכָלשֿׁ ׳וְשׁ Est 9:21 , 27 ; especially of duration of life; פ חַיֵּי שְׁנֵי ׳(יְמֵי) Gen 23:1 ; 25:7 + (P); שְׁנֵיהֶם Job 36:11 +, שְׁנוֺתַי Psa 31:11 (|| חַיַּי ), etc.; of God Job 10:5 ; Psa 102:25 ; 102:28 ; in phrase of age, see בֵּן 9 , בַּת 9 ; indefinite שָׁנִים Ezek 38:17 = for years , שׁ ׳לְקֵץ Dan 11:6 ; שָׁנִים זֶה אוֺ זֶהיָֿמִים 1Sam 29:3 ; specifically הַמֶּלֶח מוֺת בִּשְׁנַת Isa 6:1 ; 14:28 , תַּרְתָּן בֹּא בִּשְׁנַת 20:1 , הַשְּׁמִטָּה שְׁנַת Deut 15:9 ; 31:10 , הַיּוֺבֵל שְׁנַת Lev 25:13 +, etc.; שָׂכִיר שְׁנֵי Isa 16:14 ; 21:16 (see שָׂכִיר ); מְּקֻדָּתָם שְׁנַת Jer 11:23 2 t.; ׳שׁ לְי ׳רָצוֺן Isa 61:2 , etc.; דֹּרוָֿדֹר שְׁנוֺת Deut 32:7 , compare Joel 2:2 ; most often with cardinal numbers: plural after units, apposition, Exod 21:2 +, so also שְׁנִים שְׁתַּיִם 2Sam 2:10 +, but dual שְׁנָתַיִם Amos 1:1 4 t., יָמִים שְׁנָתַיִם Gen 41:1 4 t.; very rarely with number (certainly) construct שָׁנִים שְׁתֵּי 1Sam 13:1 (corrupt), שׁ ׳שְׁלשׁ Lev 25:21 ; 8 + שָׁנָה 2Kin 22:1 ; before unit (rare, late) 2Chr 11:17 (twice in verse); Dan 1:5 ; singular after 11-19, tens and hundreds Gen 5:3 , 9 ; 14:4 + often; so 90 9 years 17:24 +, rarely 30 3 years 1Kin 2:11 , etc.; but שָׁנִים אֶלֶף Psa 90:4 1000 years , so (+ מַּעֲמַיִם ) Eccl 6:6 1000 years twice over ; with compare number often repeated, 900 year 30 year Gen 5:5 , etc.; 100 year 70 year 5 years 25:7 , etc.; with cardinal number = ordinal, לְ אַרְבַּע בִּשְׁנַת 1Kin 22:41 in the fourth year of , etc., also לְ שָׁנָה חֲמִשִּׁים בִּשְׁנַת 2Kin 15:23 , etc.; but שׁ עֶשְׂרֵה ׳בְּאַרְבַּע לְ 18:13 , etc. (often), and עֶשְׂרֵה הָאַחַת בַּשָּׁנָה 1Kin 6:38 , etc.; also (c. units), הָֽרְבִיעִת בַּשָּׁנָה Lev 19:24 +, etc., + לְ 2Kin 17:6 the ninth year of , etc.; and even (Ges § 134p ) לְ הַתְּשִׁיעִית בִּשְׁנַת 25:1 , compare Ezra 7:8 ; Jer 46:2 ; 51:59 +? 28:1 ; 32:1 (Qr בַּשָּׁנָה ). II. שׁנה (√of following, meaning dubious; Thes compare Arabic shine , Ethiopic = be beautiful , Di 251 , compare Philippi ZAW xxxii (1878), 79 ; but Assyrian šinîtu is dyed cloth ).","rootNote":"(in plural or (feminine) שָׁנָה ; from 81